      "title": "Styler may not restore RenderBox when leaving multi-select mode",
      "message": "The OnChildAdded hook adds a new Styler to the label every time a child Text is added. If the button recreates its text child (e.g. on config or icon change), stylers accumulate on each new label. Also, the Styler only sets RenderBox=false and never restores true when the mode changes. This relies on the base styler resetting it on each restyle, which is fragile.",
      "suggestion": "Set s.RenderBox explicitly in both branches, or guard the hook so it applies only to the 'text' child. Verify the base styler resets the value on mode change.",
